1064 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 989 0 R
/E (WhatNext Vision Motors implemented a Salesforce-based CRM solution to modernize vehicle ordering and dealership operations. The system automates vehicle order placement, validates stock availability, assigns orders to the nearest dealer, schedules test drive reminders, and updates order statuses dynamically. This transformation replaces manual and disconnected processes with a centralized, automated platform, improving operational efficiency and customer satisfaction. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
